    <string name="instructions">Add a home screen shortcut that opens contacts with a chosen label.

Tap the button below, or add a shortcut from the launcher: long-press the home screen → Widgets → Contact Label Shortcut → Contact label.

Choose below where labels open: a contacts app or \"Contact Label Shortcut list\". The list opens instantly and has buttons to call, send an SMS or open a chat in a messenger. Long-press the call or SMS button to choose a number. The magnifier at the top searches by name or number. Long-press a messenger button for its calls. Swipes and long press on a contact are set below.</string>
